Pre-condition:
1. Login success from conative-sign-in.spec.ts
Steps:
1. Hover on the 'Product Analytics' menu
2. Click on the 'Product Performance' sub menu
3. Verify that 'Product Performance' is display
4. Click on the 'Products' Dropdown
5. Select 'Variants' option
5. Enter search keyword with 'N6435GWTCZ18'
6. Verify that show all variants with SKU contains keyword is 'N6435GWTCZ18'
7. Verify that 'Save as new view' button is display
8. Click on the 'Save as new view' button
9. Verify that 'Name new view' popup is display
10. Enter 'CBI TEST DP 02'
11. Click 'Save' button
12. Verify that show message 'Saved new view.'
13. Verify that 'CBI TEST DP 02' tab is selected
14. Click on the 3 dot of 'CBI TEST DP 02' tab 
15. Select 'Delete view' option
16. Verify that show 'Delete view' popup
17. Verify that show context 'Are you sure you want to delete "CBI TEST DP 02" view?'
18. Click 'Delete' button
19. Verify that show 'Successfully deleted CBI TEST DP 02' message
